# The task bundles are copies of private research projects, and this repository is
# public.  The manifests, prompts and the build script are committed; the copied
# bytes are not.  `build_tasks.py --verify` re-checks them on the machine that holds
# the projects.  Answer keys live outside the repository (see answers/README.md).
inputs/

# Run evidence: the command logs are the record of what an arm actually did, so the
# repository-wide `*.log` ignore is lifted for exactly these four files.
!runs/**/calls.log
